OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with variable amounts of
OL,6,Fcloud and some sunny spells, the best
OL,7,Fin the southwest. Fresh to strong east
OL,8,For southeasterly winds along the
OL,9,FSolway coast and the Rhinns.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be a dry evening and
OL,12,Fnight with mostly clear skies. Frost
OL,13,Fwill become widespread inland and in
OL,14,Fthe east, less cold but breezy over
OL,15,Fsouthwestern coasts.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FAnother dry day with some long
OL,18,Fsunny spells for most though the far
OL,19,Fwest will turn cloudier later. Cold
OL,20,Fwith some frost early and late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
